---
// packages/web/src/components/ValueProposition.astro
---

<section id="value" class="py-24 bg-surface-0">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
      Two native assets, zero friction
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 mb-8">
      Bridging Bitcoin and stablecoin economies in one network.
    </p>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Snowside natively uses <strong class="text-btc">BTC</strong> for gas and transaction fees, preserving the
      economic model of Bitcoin. At the same time, a standard <strong class="text-usdc">USDC bridge</strong> from
      Avalanche's C‑Chain is integrated from day one, allowing users to bring in stable liquidity
      without exposure to volatile assets.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      No competing token. No new consensus token. Just BTC &amp; USDC, secure and fast.
    </p>

    <!-- Asset badge row -->
    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-surface-2 border border-white/10 px-6 py-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-btc">₿</span>
        <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-btc">BTC Gas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-surface-2 border border-white/10 px-6 py-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-usdc">$</span>
        <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-usdc">USDC Bridge</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
